{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（4日）凌晨4時許，東九龍總區交通部執行及管制組人員在新蒲崗彩虹道5號設置路障期間，發現一輛私家車行車不穩，於是上前截查。</p><p>警員發現34歲江姓男司機身上有酒氣。經初步調查，未能通過酒精呼氣測試，涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕，現正被扣留調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260704/1149968514530938880805741.jpeg/Q8751m8zo-UCOqcxN6hp1dExd12lWxRyeN3ZX0Ld2V8\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260704/1149968519136415744761934.jpeg/p3qI7lr6ErUdpyOia2iCLlqd2_KugMNRpisef5wrHn8\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-03T22:58:05.794497+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}